OL,3,GNEWSAWaste recycling centre to close
OL,4,Afor 15 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FA household recycling centre on the
OL,7,Fedge of a city will close for 15 months
OL,8,Fwhile its replacement is built.
OL,10,FMilton Household Recycling Centre, near
OL,11,FCambridge, will shut on 18 January and
OL,12,Fresidents will be able to use eight
OL,13,Fother sites around the county instead.
OL,15,FCambridgeshire County Council said the
OL,16,Fnew centre, which will be built on the
OL,17,Fexisting site and adjoining land, will
OL,18,Fbe more user-friendly and include
OL,19,Fbetter traffic management, more parking
OL,20,Fand steps will be removed to give
OL,21,Fpeople level access.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
