OL,3,GNEWSAWaste recycling centre to close
OL,4,Afor 15 months
OL,5,
OL,6,FRos Hathorn, the chair of the council's
OL,7,FEnvironment and Green Investment
OL,8,FCommittee, said the new site would "be
OL,9,Feasier to use, and its design will make
OL,10,Fvisits smoother and more convenient".
